	"FriendlyName": "KzGameplay - KzUI Integration",
	"Description": "Shows KzGameplay inputs in KzUI: an icon source and {Input.Tag} tokens that display the key of the action an input tag fires for the player now, through the input profiles of their pawn. Requires the KzUI plugin.",
	"Category": "Gameplay",
	"CreatedBy": "kirzo",
